The group also stated that after more than 5000 actions taken with the aim of improving nutrition for mothers and children, the Government has announced the financing of the "The Power of Nutrition" project that will provide food interventions for 5 million women and children.
In the answer to one of the most common questions on your website, which read: "Why do you think we can end extreme poverty?"
“It’s going to be a long and difficult journey – we’re going to fail.
